```json
{
  "ok": false,
  "issues": [
    "key_value cites a 3% allowable increase for July 1, 2025 - June 30, 2026. Neither source excerpt states that figure. That period also ended before the 2026-10-01 as-of date, so the value is both unsupported and stale. It is replaced with a statement that the current percentage is not given in these sources.",
    "coverage_logic omits that the RSO also covers replacement units under LAMC Section 151.28. The source states this expressly. No allowed field can express it, so it is encoded with other_fact.",
    "coverage_logic covers every pre-10/1/1978 property type, including a stand-alone single-family house. The source's list of covered types includes only 'two or more single-family dwelling units on the same parcel' (and ADUs/JADUs). A lone single-family dwelling is therefore added as an exemption.",
    "The condominium/townhome carve-out for tenancies that began after December 31, 1995 depends on tenancy start date, which is not an allowed field. It correctly stays in the exemptions text and is not added to coverage_logic.",
    "status in_force, subject landlord, yields_to_local/preempts_local false, and the null effective_date are consistent with the sources. The requirement text accurately reflects the February 2, 2026 removal of the utilities and dependent percentages and the retained 10% additional-tenant increase."
  ],
  "scope": "core",
  "applies_only_in": [],
  "conflict_unresolved": false,
  "conflict_note": null,
  "fix": {
    "coverage_logic": {
      "covers": {
        "any": [
          {"field": "certificate_of_occupancy", "op": "<=", "value": "1978-10-01"},
          {"field": "other_fact", "op": "==", "value": "unit is a replacement unit under LAMC Section 151.28"}
        ]
      },
      "exempt": {
        "all": [
          {"field": "property_type", "op": "==", "value": "single_family"},
          {"field": "units", "op": "<=", "value": 1}
        ]
      }
    },
    "key_value": "One increase per 12 months, capped at the LAHD annual allowable percentage (the current percentage is not stated in these sources); no added utilities or dependent percentage from 2026-02-02; +10% for an additional non-dependent tenant, taken within 60 days of the landlord learning of that tenant"
  }
}
```
